## Third-Party Acknowledgements

This project incorporates design patterns and concepts inspired by the following
open-source projects, each licensed under MIT:

- **obra/superpowers** (https://github.com/obra/superpowers) — Pipeline orchestration patterns
- **mattpocock/skills** (https://github.com/mattpocock/skills) — Grill, guardrails,
  CONTEXT.md, and ADR patterns
- **gastownhall/beads** (https://github.com/gastownhall/beads) — Issue tracking workflow
- **uditgoenka/autoresearch** (https://github.com/uditgoenka/autoresearch) — Auto-research
  optimization gates
